  "details": "1. Open vrchat, 2. Span the app across both screens before it finishes loading 3. app rotates and crashes\n\nalternatively \n\n1. Open Vrchat, 2, wait for menus to load, then span the screens 3. Launch into game 3. rotate screen at anytime, autobots rollout!\n\nIf you attempt to rotate the screen again, the app hangs, filling 3/4 of the screen, becomes permanently fixed to the screens, and forces you to restart the phone to clear it.\n\nany rotation on the device causes odd behavior, and a crash\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1G84lsxFkG6iSbEwfUIb2wnwMnUzjorlJ?usp=sharing",
